      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we want this `getPath` method at all, but if we did the body would be written like `this-\u003egetIfPath(glyphID)).value_or(SkPath())`. Unfortunately, `std::optional::or_else` is C++23 so one still needs to rely on the compiler to optimize things, but no non-trivial (aka test) user should be doing this.",
